OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 1 JAN
OL,4,G1230FDeb Grant
OL,5,     GDeb's got the finest music to
OL,6,     Gmotivate your Thursday, with the
OL,7,     Gbest tunes old and new.
OL,8,G1300FCraig Charles
OL,9,     GCraig's here to help you through
OL,10,     GNew Year's Day with three hours
OL,11,     Gof great music. Plus, there's
OL,12,     Ganother game of 'Either/Or': two
OL,13,     Gtracks, one theme, YOU decide
OL,14,     Gwhich wins.
OL,15,G1600FJamz Supernova
OL,16,     GJamz welcomes in 2026 with the
OL,17,     Gfirst Home Run of the year at
OL,18,     G5pm. Plus, Emily Pilbeam joins
OL,19,     Gwith ears on an artist for 2026
OL,20,     Gand we repeat a Kelly Lee Owens
OL,21,     GMorning After Mix.
